{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1716"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/games","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-sport-games__games.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",570],["+","Angry Birds | 2009 | Rovio | Fling birds at the towers of green pigs |\n| "],["=",388],["+","Physics puzzles conquered the phone first. Angry Birds, released by the Finnish studio Rovio for the iPhone in December 2009, has the player fire birds from a slingshot at wobbly towers sheltering green pigs, who have stolen the birds' eggs. "],["=",2],["+","pigs live on Piggy Island, the setting of the games and later of The Angry Birds Movie of 2016.\n\nThe "],["=",105]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",506],["+","Angry Birds | 2009 | Rovio | Vögel auf die Türme grüner Schweine schleudern |\n| "],["=",378],["+","Physik-Puzzles eroberten das Handy zuerst. In Angry Birds, im Dezember 2009 vom finnischen Studio Rovio für das iPhone veröffentlicht, schießt der Spieler Vögel mit einer Schleuder auf wacklige Türme, hinter denen sich grüne Schweine verstecken, die den Vögeln die Eier gestohlen haben. Die Schweine leben auf der Schweineinsel (Piggy Island), dem Schauplatz der Spiele und später des Films „Angry Birds – "],["=",2],["+","Film“ von 2016.\n\nDer "],["=",95]]}]},
